            "review_title": "Review at San Fu Lou - Cantonese Kitchen - Crescent Mall",
            "review_text": "Vegetarian_For_Good\n12 contributions\n0\nLots of Potential but Fell Short: San Fu Lou Chinese Restaurant (Ho Chi Minh City's Crescent Mall)\nFeb 2024 • Family\nSan Fu Lou Chinese Restaurant, located in Ho Chi Minh City’s Crescent Mall, has much potential but hasn’t met it yet.\n\n620,000 VND, 2 PAX (tea, fried rice, rice, fried noodles, bok choy, soup, tea)\n\n-----------------\n\nThe Plusses\n\nThe atmosphere was comfortable, the service was great, and the food was indeed tasty. Although they have few vegetarian options (two vegetable dishes, asparagus, and bok choy), the kitchen was quite accommodating in producing dishes without meat: fried rice, fried noodles, and mushroom soup. The tea was great, too.\n\n-----------------\n\nThe Downside\n\nEach dish was great, but the delivery timing made each rather unappetizing. Each dish was served by itself, with about a 10-minute gap between each. After about 15 minutes of ordering the meal, tea was delivered and then came the vegetables, a bowl of white rice, fried rice, fried noodles, and finally, soup. It was a long evening, and dishes that ought to complement each other by being eaten together (e.g., rice and vegetables) had to be eaten separately.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 8, 2024\nD1 Concepts Corporation\nDear Mr. Vegetarian_for_Good,\n\nFirstly, thank you for taking the time to come to our restaurant and your detailed feedback!\n\nRegarding your unsatisfactory experience with the delivery timing. If possible, can you provide us with the information (name, phone number, date/time) that you made your reservation at San Fu Lou? The customer service staff will contact you immediately to listen to more specific comments about your problems. We will check internally with the restaurant about your feedback for improvement. You can send us your information through our FanPage San Fu Lou Cantonese Restaurant.\n\nOnce again, thank you for your contributions and we look forward to serving you again!\nRead more\nWritten March 11, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
